---
// Final CTA + footer — GameHub parity: big closing band, then company/legal footer.
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-white/8">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 h-[320px] w-[720px] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-gold/10 blur-[120px]"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="reveal relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-20 text-center sm:px-6">
    <p class="font-display text-[13px] tracking-[0.2em] text-gold">SAMBA S3</p>
    <h2 data-glitch class="mt-4 font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-cream sm:text-5xl">YOUR COUCH.<br />YOUR DISCS. YOUR POCKET PS3.</h2>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <a href="#download" class="btn-gold rounded bg-gold px-7 py-3.5 font-heading text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.14em] text-abyss transition hover:bg-focus">⬇ &nbsp;DOWNLOAD SAMBAS3</a>
      <a href="https://discord.gg/t6dzA4wUdG" class="rounded border border-gold/40 px-7 py-3.5 font-heading text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.14em] text-gold transition hover:border-focus hover:text-focus">JOIN DISCORD</a>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-5 font-mono2 text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] text-faint">ANDROID 10+ · ARM64 · GPLv2 · NO GAMES INCLUDED</p>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="border-t border-white/8 bg-[#070a14]">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr_1fr_1fr]">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <img src="icon.png" alt="SambaS3 icon" class="h-9 w-9 rounded-md border border-gold/40" width="36" height="36" />
        <span class="font-display text-[13px] tracking-[0.18em] text-gold">SAMBA<span class="text-cream">S3</span></span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-xs font-body leading-relaxed text-warm">Experimental Android UI for the RPCSX emulator. Controller-first, open source, living-room flavoured.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 font-mono2 text-[11px] tracking-[0.16em] text-faint">GPLv2 · EXCEPT DIRS WITH OWN LICENSE</p>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Product">
      <p class="font-heading text-[13px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-cream">PRODUCT</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-2.5 font-body text-warm">
        <li><a href="#features" class="hover:text-gold">Features</a></li>
        <li><a href="#showcase" class="hover:text-gold">App tour</a></li>
        <li><a href="#specs" class="hover:text-gold">Specs</a></li>
        <li><a href="#download" class="hover:text-gold">Download</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <nav aria-label="Resources">
      <p class="font-heading text-[13px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-cream">RESOURCES</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-2.5 font-body text-warm">
        <li><a href="https://github.com/zenithblue-oss/samba-s3" class="hover:text-gold">GitHub ↗</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://discord.gg/t6dzA4wUdG" class="hover:text-gold">Discord ↗</a></li>
        <li><a href="#faq" class="hover:text-gold">FAQ</a></li>
        <li><a href="#setup" class="hover:text-gold">Setup guide</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <div>
      <p class="font-heading text-[13px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-cream">CONTROLLER MAP</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-2.5 font-mono2 text-[11px] tracking-[0.14em] text-warm">
        <li>✕ CONFIRM · ○ BACK</li>
        <li>△ INFO · START PAUSE</li>
        <li>LB / RB SWITCH TABS</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-white/8">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-2 px-4 py-5 font-mono2 text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] text-faint sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:px-6">
      <p>© 2026 SAMBAS3 CONTRIBUTORS · NOT AFFILIATED WITH SONY · NO GAMES OR FIRMWARE INCLUDED</p>
      <p>NAVY #0A0D1A · GOLD #C9A84C · CRT INSIDE</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
